# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Environments ---
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- macOS ---
.DS_Store

# --- Editors ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# --- Generated figures ---
# figures/make_figures.py writes here. Figures are rebuilt from results/ by
# `python figures/make_figures.py --all`, so they are not committed
# (workflow-rules.md §7). The builders are the deliverable, not the PNGs.
figures/out/

# --- Results ---
# NOTE: results/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The parquet is part of the
# record, not a build artefact (workflow-rules.md §9). Append-only, and every
# row carries code_version. Do not add results/ here.
# Scratch and exploratory runs are deleted before commit, not gitignored —
# these two patterns just stop them being staged by accident.
results/scratch/
results/*_tmp.parquet